{"id":"cbf9dd72b30d4b48","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-shoenfield-inv.md","title":"Shoenfield 的 Δ₂ 跳跃反演","display":"thm-shoenfield-inv — Shoenfield 的 Δ₂ 跳跃反演","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-shoenfield-inv","aliases":["20-thm-shoenfield-inv"],"display":"thm-shoenfield-inv — Shoenfield 的 Δ₂ 跳跃反演","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.5.15；Remark 6.5.14","source_printed_pages":[145,146],"source_pdf_pages":[179,180],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]","[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-shoenfield-inv"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-shoenfield-inv</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shoenfield-inv — Shoenfield 的 Δ₂ 跳跃反演"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.5.15；Remark 6.5.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span><span>146</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>179</span><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6330178076c4520f\" href=\"?note=6330178076c4520f\" title=\"20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set\">20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf d\\cap\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing&#39;}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf d\\cap\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing&#39;}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6330178076c4520f\" href=\"?note=6330178076c4520f\" title=\"20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set\">20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shoenfield\\text{-}inv}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\ [\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf d].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shoenfield\\text{-}inv}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\ [\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf d].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取满足假设的代表元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，对它应用上游集合构造，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\equiv_TD\">\\(A&#39;\\equiv_TD\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\\)</span> 即得结论。反向范围也成立：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\ge_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\ge_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，且由相对半判定程序替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>-c.e.。因此跳跃把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 以下的度恰映到在且高于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 的 c.e. 度。</p>\n<p>此前被归入书外 supplement 并标为 pending-source，现已在原书习题 6.5.15 找到来源，单独展开其构造后恢复为原书定理。它保证原像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>，而不保证原像是 c.e. 度；后者仍是独立的 Sacks 反演问题。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.5.15；Remark 6.5.14；印刷页 145, 146；PDF 第 179, 180 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set","status":"resolved","id":"6330178076c4520f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor"